"⚠ 掃描全部可用業者：最長阻塞 300 秒（5 分鐘），期間會中斷現有業務且無法下其他指令。": "⚠ Scans all available operators: blocks for up to 300 s (5 minutes), interrupting current service, and no other command can be issued meanwhile.",
