"讓模組在訊號變化時「主動回報」品質數據，不必狂按 AT+CSQ。SQI 給的 RSRP／RSRQ／SINR 是 LTE 真正的品質三要素 —— AT+CSQ 只有粗略 RSSI（且本機 BER 恆為 99 無參考值），天線與擺位測試非用這組不可。判讀：RSRP＝訊號強度、RSRQ＝品質、SINR＝訊噪比（越高越好，低就是被干擾）。⚠ 只在訊號「有變化」時才推播 —— 靜置不動可能長時間毫無動靜，要測就用手包住天線或拔插天線製造變化。設定不跨重開機，每次開機要重開。": "Makes the module report quality data on its own whenever the signal changes, so you do not have to hammer AT+CSQ. The RSRP / RSRQ / SINR from SQI are the three metrics that actually define LTE quality — AT+CSQ only gives a coarse RSSI (and BER is stuck at 99 on this unit, so it tells you nothing). Antenna and placement testing is impossible without this group. Reading them: RSRP = signal strength, RSRQ = quality, SINR = signal-to-noise ratio (higher is better; low means interference). ⚠ It only pushes when the signal actually changes — sitting still can mean long silence, so cup the antenna in your hand or unplug and replug it to force a change. The setting does not survive a reboot; enable it again every time.",
"查 sqi 回報目前開關（不帶值＝查詢；\"csq\"／\"all\" 同形式可查）": "Query the current sqi reporting switch (no value = query; \"csq\" / \"all\" work the same way)",
"開啟 RSRP/RSRQ/SINR 主動回報 —— 現有指令完全沒有這三個值，天線與擺位測試必備": "Enable active RSRP/RSRQ/SINR reporting — no other command gives you these three values, and antenna and placement testing needs them",
"訊號一變就主動回報，取代狂按 AT+CSQ": "Reports as soon as the signal changes, replacing repeated AT+CSQ presses",
"會關閉全部 URC 回報：GNSS / TCP-IP / MQTT / Wi-Fi 掃描的所有事件通知都會靜默。": "Disables all URC reporting: every event notification from GNSS / TCP-IP / MQTT / Wi-Fi Scan goes silent.",
"一鍵靜音（終端被 URC 洗版時用）—— 記得事後開回來": "One-click mute (for when URCs flood the terminal) — remember to turn it back on afterwards",
"恢復全部 URC 回報": "Restore all URC reporting",
"PDP context＝電信網路配給的「資料通道」，有它才有 IP 可用。這組是 3GPP 標準層的唯讀查詢，與 TCP/IP 頁的 QIACT?／QICSGP「不是同一層」 —— 那邊是 Quectel 自家協定堆疊。兩層可能不一致，並排比對就能分辨故障在網路側還是模組側：這裡有 IP、TCP/IP 頁卻沒有，代表網路給了但堆疊沒啟動。本機開機就會自動啟用 context 1 並取得 IP（實測），一般不需手動介入。": "A PDP context is the \"data channel\" the carrier allocates; without one there is no usable IP. This group is read-only queries at the 3GPP standard layer, which is NOT the same layer as QIACT? / QICSGP on the TCP/IP page — those belong to Quectel's own protocol stack. The two layers can disagree, and comparing them side by side tells you whether the fault is on the network side or the module side: an IP here but none on the TCP/IP page means the network granted one but the stack never started. This unit activates context 1 and gets an IP automatically at power-on (measured), so manual intervention is normally unnecessary.",
"已定義的 PDP context 與 APN（每個 context 一行）": "Defined PDP contexts and APNs (one line per context)",
"最長 150 秒": "Up to 150 s",
"各 context 的啟用狀態（回應是 cid,state；寫入式順序相反要注意）": "Activation state of each context (the response is cid,state; note that the write form takes them in the opposite order)",
"各 context 實際取得的 IP —— 3GPP 層拿到 IP 不代表 Quectel 堆疊已啟動": "The IP each context actually obtained — an IP at the 3GPP layer does not mean the Quectel stack is up",
"累計送出／接收位元組（跨開機累計；漫遊卡測流量用）": "Cumulative bytes sent/received (accumulates across reboots; useful for metering a roaming SIM)",
"上一次失敗的詳細原因（涵蓋附著與 PDP 啟用失敗）—— 與 TCP/IP 頁的 QIGETERROR 是不同層": "Detailed cause of the last failure (covers attach and PDP activation failures) — a different layer from QIGETERROR on the TCP/IP page",
"控制射頻與網路附著 —— 整組都會改變模組狀態（紅框鈕按下前都會再問一次）。CFUN 功能等級：1＝全功能、4＝飛航（關收發、SIM 還在）、0＝最小（SIM 也停用）、1,1＝軟重啟整顆模組。復原一律是 AT+CFUN=1；⚠ SIM 若有 PIN 鎖，切回 1 之後要重新輸入 PIN 才會註冊。CGATT 則是 PS 域附著開關，脫離會打掉所有 TCP／MQTT 連線。這組指令最長可阻塞 15～140 秒，按下後耐心等回應、別連打。": "Controls the radio and the network attach — everything here changes module state (every red-framed button asks again before acting). CFUN levels: 1 = full functionality, 4 = airplane (TX/RX off, SIM still alive), 0 = minimum (SIM disabled too), 1,1 = soft-reset the whole module. Recovery is always AT+CFUN=1; ⚠ if the SIM has a PIN lock you must re-enter the PIN after going back to 1 before it registers. CGATT is the PS domain attach switch, and detaching kills every TCP/MQTT connection. Commands here can block for 15 to 140 s — wait patiently after pressing, do not mash the button.",
"最長 15 秒": "Up to 15 s",
"查目前功能等級：1=全功能、0=最小、4=關 RF —— 按下面的設定鈕之前先看這條": "Query the current functionality level: 1=full, 0=minimum, 4=RF off — check this before pressing the set buttons below",
"會重新開啟射頻並重新搜網／附著，可能中斷正在進行的 TCP / MQTT 測試。": "Re-enables the radio and re-scans and re-attaches, which may interrupt a TCP / MQTT test in progress.",
"恢復完整功能（射頻全開）—— 關掉射頻後用這條復原": "Restore full functionality (radio fully on) — use this to recover after turning the radio off",
"會關閉射頻收發：立刻脫網、斷掉所有 PDP 與 socket。用 AT+CFUN=1 復原。": "Turns the radio off: drops off the network immediately and kills every PDP and socket. Recover with AT+CFUN=1.",
"飛航模式（收發全關）—— 測「重新入網」流程的起點": "Airplane mode (TX and RX off) — the starting point for testing the re-entry-to-network flow",
"最小功能模式：會脫網，且 SIM 也會停用（AT+CPIN? 會回 +CME ERROR: 13）。用 AT+CFUN=1 復原。": "Minimum functionality mode: drops off the network and disables the SIM as well (AT+CPIN? returns +CME ERROR: 13). Recover with AT+CFUN=1.",
"最小功能（手冊只寫 Minimum functionality，未說明關掉哪些子系統）": "Minimum functionality (the manual only says \"Minimum functionality\" and never states which subsystems it turns off)",
"⚠ 會軟重啟整顆模組！AT 口會短暫失效，之後要重新等 RDY。所有連線與未存檔設定都會消失。": "⚠ Soft-resets the whole module! The AT port goes dead briefly and you have to wait for RDY again. Every connection and unsaved setting is lost.",
