"⚠ 會中斷資料承載：TCP/IP 頁已開的 socket 與 MQTT 頁的連線會一起被打掉。最長阻塞 140 秒。": "⚠ Breaks the data bearer: sockets opened on the TCP/IP page and connections on the MQTT page all go down with it. Blocks for up to 140 s.",
"手動脫離 PS 域 —— 測「重新附著」流程用": "Detach from the PS domain manually — for testing the re-attach flow",
"GNSS 開關狀態：0=關、1=開": "GNSS on/off state: 0=off, 1=on",
"列出全部 GNSS 組態子項與可設範圍": "List every GNSS configuration sub-item and its settable range",
