"MQTT broker 的域名或 IP": "The MQTT broker's domain name or IP",
"MQTT broker 的域名或 IP，四個選項都免費、允許匿名、不必註冊（2026-08-07 全部實機實測：四家從模組都連得上 TCP 1883）。預設 mqttgo.io 是台灣本地服務，對台灣使用者延遲最低。⚠ 這些都是「完全公開」的 broker —— 任何人都能訂閱你發布的主題，也可能有別人的訊息混進來，測試時「絕對不要送真實資料」，主題請加隨機尾碼。TLS 埠：mqttgo.io 與其餘皆為 8883（mosquitto 免 CA 驗證的是 8886）。": "Domain name or IP of the MQTT broker. All four options are free, allow anonymous access and need no registration (all four verified on real hardware 2026-08-07: the module reached TCP 1883 on every one). The default, mqttgo.io, is hosted in Taiwan and gives Taiwanese users the lowest latency. ⚠ These are fully public brokers — anyone can subscribe to the topics you publish, and other people's messages may show up in yours. Never send real data while testing, and add a random suffix to your topic. TLS ports: 8883 for mqttgo.io and the rest (mosquitto's CA-free port is 8886).",
