"仍會連線並消耗 1NCE 流量，但只取 {rlen} 位元組。限制：只有在 AT+QHTTPCFG=\"requestheader\",0 時可執行；伺服器會固定以 206（Partial Content）回應。": "It still connects and consumes 1NCE traffic, but fetches only {rlen} bytes. Restrictions: it can only run while AT+QHTTPCFG=\"requestheader\",0, and the server always answers with 206 (Partial Content).",
"以 PDP 1、SSL context 1 建立到指定主機與埠的連線，clientID 指定為 4，末碼 0＝緩衝取回模式，先回 OK 再等 URC 回報結果。": "Open a connection to the given host and port over PDP 1 and SSL context 1 with clientID 4; the trailing 0 = buffer retrieval mode. It returns OK first, then the URC reports the result.",
"以 PDP 1、SSL context 1 連指定主機與埠，末碼 1＝直推模式，收到資料直接由 +QSSLURC 連同內容吐出，不需再下 QSSLRECV 讀取。": "Connect to the given host and port over PDP 1 and SSL context 1; the trailing 1 = direct push mode, where received data is emitted with its content by +QSSLURC and no QSSLRECV is needed.",
"以 hex 字串送資料到 connectID 0；單行免資料模式 —— QISEND 要 Ctrl+Z，本工具送不出，一律用這個": "Send data to connectID 0 as a hex string; single line, no data mode — QISEND needs Ctrl+Z, which this tool cannot send, so always use this one",
"以十六進位字串向 connectID 0 送出 5 位元組，字串上限 512 bytes": "Send 5 bytes to connectID 0 as a hex string; the string is limited to 512 bytes",
"以十六進位字串送資料，兩個 hex 字元＝一個 byte，上限 512 bytes；SEND OK 只代表進了模組緩衝": "Send data as a hex string; two hex characters = one byte, limit 512 bytes; SEND OK only means it made it into the module's buffer",
