"分段 GET：從位移 {0} 取 {1} bytes（走 HTTP Range，成功時伺服器回 206）。⚠ 只在 QHTTPCFG=\"requestheader\",0 時可執行；伺服器不支援 Range 就會回 200 加整份內容（實測 httpbin /base64 即如此，要用 /range/N 才驗得到）": "Ranged GET: read {1} bytes from offset {0} (uses an HTTP Range request; the server answers 206 on success). ⚠ Only works while QHTTPCFG=\"requestheader\",0; a server without Range support answers 200 with the whole body instead (measured on httpbin /base64 — use /range/N to verify this properly)",
