"啟用 TCP keepalive（閒置秒數／探測間隔／探測次數）—— 這是 TCP 層探測，擋不住伺服器的「應用層」閒置逾時，用途是電信商 NAT 保活與偵測死連線": "Enable TCP keepalive (idle seconds / probe interval / probe count) — this is a TCP-layer probe: it will not stop a server's \"application-layer\" idle timeout; its purpose is keeping the carrier's NAT mapping alive and detecting dead connections",
