"啟用後（要重開機才生效）每次 GNSS 啟動會從網路下載輔助資料：需要已啟用的 PDP context，並消耗數據流量（1NCE 漫遊卡計費，單次約數十 KB）。": "Once enabled (a reboot is required), every GNSS start downloads assistance data from the network: it needs an active PDP context and consumes data (billed on the 1NCE roaming SIM, roughly tens of KB per run).",
