"實際送出的位元組。長度以 UTF-8 計並自動填入指令的 <sendlen>（中文字算 3 bytes），上限 1460 bytes（手冊 §2.2.3）。注意：本欄是文字輸入框，打不出 CR/LF 等控制字元，所以像 HTTP 請求那種需要以 \\r\\n\\r\\n 收尾的協定送不完整。": "The bytes actually sent. The length is counted in UTF-8 and filled into the command's <sendlen> automatically (a Chinese character counts as 3 bytes), limit 1460 bytes (manual §2.2.3). Note: this is a text input, so you cannot type control characters such as CR/LF — protocols that must end with \\r\\n\\r\\n, like an HTTP request, cannot be sent in full.",
"對 clientID 4 送出固定長度 17 bytes：模組回 > 提示後須輸入滿 17 bytes 才送出，單次上限 1460、超出範圍回 ERROR。": "Send a fixed 17 bytes to clientID 4: after the module's > prompt you must enter all 17 bytes before it sends; the per-call limit is 1460 and out-of-range values return ERROR.",
