"查目前的 TCP keepalive 設定：回 <enable>[,<idle_time>,<interval_time>,<probe_cnt>]": "Query the current TCP keepalive setting: returns <enable>[,<idle_time>,<interval_time>,<probe_cnt>]",
"格式": "Format",
"業者 {0}": "Operator {0}",
"業者名稱為空字串": "Operator name is an empty string",
"模組回 > 之後會「數滿指定長度的位元組」才送出。若長度算錯或中途取消，AT 口會卡在資料模式吞掉後續指令 —— 本工具送不出 ESC（0x1B）取消，只能關連線或重啟模組脫身。資料會實際上網，產生流量。": "After the module replies >, it only sends once it has counted the exact number of bytes you declared. If the length is wrong or you abort midway, the AT port stays stuck in data mode and swallows every command that follows — this tool cannot send ESC (0x1B) to cancel, so the only ways out are closing the connection or restarting the module. The data really goes online and costs traffic.",
"模組回 > 之後會「數滿指定長度的位元組」才送出。若長度算錯或中途取消，AT 口會卡在資料模式吞掉後續指令 —— 用 Hardware 頁的原始位元組按鈕送 ESC（0x1B）即可脫身，不必關連線或重啟模組。資料會實際上網，產生流量。": "After the module answers >, it sends only once it has counted the exact number of bytes you declared. If the length is wrong or you abandon it midway, the AT port stays in data mode and swallows everything you type next — send ESC (0x1B) with the raw-byte button on the Hardware page to get out; you do not have to close the connection or restart the module. The data really goes over the network and costs traffic.",
