"要送出的資料，以十六進位字串表示（48656C6C6F0A = Hello 加換行）。上限 512 bytes。⚠ 結尾那個 0A（換行）不是裝飾：預設對端 tcpbin.com 是「以行為單位」的 echo 伺服器，收不到換行就一直緩衝著不回送 —— 實測送 Hello 不加 0A 等 6 秒毫無回應，補一個 0A 後 0.1 秒立刻收到。改連別的伺服器時再依對方協定決定要不要保留": "The data to send, written as a hex string (48656C6C6F0A = Hello plus a newline). Limit 512 bytes. ⚠ That trailing 0A (newline) is not decoration: the default peer tcpbin.com is a \"line-oriented\" echo server, and until it sees a newline it just keeps buffering and sends nothing back — measured: sending Hello without 0A gave no response at all after 6 s, while appending a single 0A brought it back within 0.1 s. When you point it at a different server, let that server's protocol decide whether to keep it",
"要送出的資料，以十六進位字串表示（範例 48656C6C6F = Hello）。上限 512 bytes": "The data to send, written as a hex string (example 48656C6C6F = Hello). Limit 512 bytes",
"要連線的伺服器 IP 位址或域名。預設 tcpbin.com 是免費公開的 TCP echo 服務：送什麼就原樣回什麼，不必註冊、不必自己架伺服器、也不必動路由器設定 —— 模組是 TCP client，主動往外連即可，這是消費者環境唯一必然可行的方向。": "The server IP address or domain name to connect to. The default tcpbin.com is a free public TCP echo service: it returns whatever you send, with no registration, no server of your own and no router configuration — the module is a TCP client dialing outward, which is the only direction that always works in a consumer environment.",
